{"id":"vod_lz_31205","vodId":"31205","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"火影忍者疾风传","name_cn":"火影忍者疾风传","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220820-1/f12094b7e9b7900c49507aba51a1241c.jpg"},"summary":"　　疾风传指的是佐助投奔大蛇丸后三年发生的故事，故疾风传也可以理解为《火影忍者》第二部。　　不知不觉《火影忍者》已经一路走了七年，鸣人从万年吊车尾的倒霉蛋慢慢地成长为能独当一面的忍者。从莽撞单纯的英雄主义男主角一步又一步地向忍道的达人迈进。为了友情，为了爱，为了被认可，为了自己的忍道，鸣人头也不回的奋斗了整整7年，以疾风的速度成长着。撒花庆贺的同时好消息自然不能少！2007早春火影动画也回归漫画突入第二章，冗长乏味的TV动画，终于顺应民意走回“正途”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动作,科幻,动画,惊悚,冒险"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-08-20 02:51:48","classic":true,"classicRank":35,"franchise":"火影忍者","playable":true,"episodeCount":500,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220819/22438_d77d3260/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21938_57ff27eb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21940_546858a4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21941_c8f193a9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21944_030aa3d5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21946_19602275/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21948_4e240713/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21949_c84e4db9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21952_c8a7a25d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21953_01ea9407/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21955_41242618/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21957_f2ad99a2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21960_7a817c50/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20220818/21963_8e57a707/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","ur